d="03:02.869">no </span><span begin="03:02.869" end="03:03.222">na </span><span begin="03:03.222" end="03:03.502">ra</span></text><text for="line-47f6dc49-be4b-48b4-b431-ade52b82eaab"><span begin="03:03.662" end="03:03.822">bo </span><span begin="03:03.822" end="03:03.980">ku </span><span begin="03:03.980" end="03:04.147">wa </span><span begin="03:04.147" end="03:04.441">ya </span><span begin="03:04.441" end="03:04.786">ka </span><span begin="03:04.786" end="03:05.102">wo </span><span begin="03:05.102" end="03:05.382">i </span><span begin="03:05.382" end="03:05.702">ki </span><span begin="03:05.702" end="03:05.856">yo </span><span begin="03:05.856" end="03:05.979">u</span></text><text for="line-4c945373-dd94-4c2c-bf3e-63aeada8cbcf"><span begin="03:05.979" end="03:06.202">shi </span><span begin="03:06.202" end="03:06.442">n </span><span begin="03:06.442" end="03:06.674">ku </span><span begin="03:06.674" end="03:06.962">no </span><span begin="03:06.962" end="03:07.195">ya </span><span begin="03:07.195" end="03:07.273">i </span><span begin="03:07.273" end="03:07.941">ba</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle"><text for="line-1b757ded-548c-4c03-a94c-73959a84b885">跨过尸骸前行吧</text><text for="line-a8567291-ede7-4315-a939-8479266ab69f">这片化作焦土的大地</text><text for="line-3eca89ce-f92b-4b37-adc2-b21e86f94210">被灰色的雨涂成黑色</text><text for="line-41a57498-3f95-40d6-87ae-11a979bd9e4c">并掩埋殆尽 Silence</text><text for="line-2a8c3b6e-8de5-45b4-8863-a623a282ff51">高举各自的觉悟（武器）</text><text for="line-7d74939b-d3db-4975-a75a-6333aa7d3125">结束战斗的同志们啊</text><text for="line-3c2a6701-03d7-44b4-ad30-e0c79b631843">直到重逢的那一天</text><text for="line-2a9a62e5-a2c8-46cb-9117-ed860309b653">恐惧与迷茫</text><text for="line-611100bf-1ad8-4cdb-a2e8-85a1217a28cf">几度重叠 无边无际般</text><text for="line-2abc0c00-e1f0-4df3-8aa2-b3547a429272">化作高高耸立的障壁</text><text for="line-d71ea443-39da-44eb-9e52-c07d3ac9809e">剑正呼唤着</text><text for="line-dda2ccf8-6115-4647-9a1d-a4dabe988a91">拳中的 my patience</text><text for="line-b99407f6-0318-4c2f-b8e9-091bc9ff068f">在相遇与离别的轮回（往复）前方</text><text for="line-3675cad0-69bc-4595-bd51-d2acd810807f">若这即将燃尽的世界</text><text for="line-0b145d0b-0fd3-4bf4-a580-e9d090ca7532">能够存续到第7日的话</text><text for="line-f5c0eacd-65b2-4d59-bb98-a1f9fb0fa54d">那我便要活到第8天</text><text for="line-fb9de7a8-15d6-4121-b987-b594d2b3c27b">真红之刃</text><text for="line-faac08e5-ca7d-4377-a65d-175226db0468">即便同归于尽</text><text for="line-5462ab03-8710-4a9c-bfd8-254bf4536016">也要在这胸中绽放荣光（花朵）</text><text for="line-f171d570-0b6c-4d6b-9880-6a1a4822f42e">如果跨过那一天活下来的证明</text><text for="line-9ee8dfae-8fd4-4261-b283-afd0e13b5a97">能化作道路的话</text><text for="line-471a4b8b-462b-47f2-a136-512a969ef515">至少让结局</text><text for="line-c73cd3cb-858b-4b91-9f4a-f845a22f1510">在你的记忆里</text><text for="line-ab7631e4-44e1-48d7-bf05-564e61485361">是绚烂华美的模样</text><text for="line-89ba282d-5835-4dd6-8f99-82807bda76b4">如此祈愿着</text><text for="line-2419d74f-78a2-4649-bf29-783921749b23">剑依然记得</text><text for="line-3414a794-c1df-4803-969b-b1b67cd02f9f">那快要消逝的 sacrifice</text><text for="line-c70b8541-8b7f-4a9f-940d-b4eca7746f63">用颤抖的双脚将大地</text><text for="line-8e7b783d-b6ac-4b2b-b09b-f16a132ad2a4">牢牢踏实前行吧</text><text for="line-29fad35e-628b-45f6-b3b4-efd8a5d49532">若谁都渴望的未来</text><text for="line-d7743fe7-b0cd-4065-84e1-48626c2e7ded">能够逃离到第7日的话</text><text for="line-5f83a3bb-d886-4f53-9499-11bb9cc17fe2">那我便要奔跑到第8天</text><text for="line-c86a50b9-4fc8-4067-a9aa-52b34279794e">真红之刃</text><text for="line-f147392c-dbf6-4069-a4a6-642692935850">剑正呼唤着</text><text for="line-5af57fba-ebf0-4f8c-8be8-19048b662e31">拳中的 my patience</text><text for="line-6ec67946-30c3-4869-a9bd-5be3ad21c1d4">在相遇与离别的轮回（往复）前方</text><text for="line-9f1de6df-1f26-429d-85e5-161942d392b7">若这即将燃尽的世界</text><text for="line-f143042a-2e9d-4ed0-adeb-d197487a5b96">能够存续到第7日的话</text><text for="line-47f6dc49-be4b-48b4-b431-ade52b82eaab">那我便要活到第8天</text><text for="line-4c945373-dd94-4c2c-bf3e-63aeada8cbcf">真红之刃</text></translation></translatio